{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I lifted</b> — the first vision was not completed, except with this." "<b>And the meaning of \"two women\"</b> — the two officers of Artaxerxes, who was king of Babylon, who would do violence to the families of Israel remaining in Babylon who did not heed the command of YHWH through His prophet to come to the Second Temple. And these would not let the woman, which is the family of Israel sitting inside the ephah, escape from there."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:03.167956837Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}